{"4659560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "天仙月", "steam_appid": 4659560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Celestial Moon》 The &quot;Sword Bearer&quot; must collect five scattered artifacts across the land, forge them into the Dragon-Subduing Sword, and seal the Demon Dragon away. On their journey, they arrive at Celestial City only to witness a Demon Dragon assault. There, the Sword Bearer joins forces with the Celestial Elf and sect mentors to thwart the Dragon God Cult's plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning visuals, immersive sound effects, and a wealth of gameplay content. Six major sects with freely customizable builds, classic Chinese fantasy heritage, exploration across the Three Realms, and the ultimate mission to seal the Demon Dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich gameplay including sect missions, ghost hunting, and merchant runs — classic mechanics that are easy to pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional turn-based combat with interwoven mechanics of speed, charge, counterattack, dodge, and barrier spells — a single battle can accommodate dozens of tactical approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of spirit beasts to freely capture and collect, classic skill-book fusion system, freely assignable stat points, and the ability to switch between DPS / Tank / Support roles on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely craft your equipment, freely mix and match builds, and journey across the realms of man, god, and demon to establish a new order of coexistence in this wild primordial world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Celestial Moon》 The &quot;Sword Bearer&quot; must collect five scattered artifacts across the land, forge them into the Dragon-Subduing Sword, and seal the Demon Dragon away. On their journey, they arrive at Celestial City only to witness a Demon Dragon assault. There, the Sword Bearer joins forces with the Celestial Elf and sect mentors to thwart the Dragon God Cult's plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning visuals, immersive sound effects, and a wealth of gameplay content. Six major sects with freely customizable builds, classic Chinese fantasy heritage, exploration across the Three Realms, and the ultimate mission to seal the Demon Dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich gameplay including sect missions, ghost hunting, and merchant runs — classic mechanics that are easy to pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional turn-based combat with interwoven mechanics of speed, charge, counterattack, dodge, and barrier spells — a single battle can accommodate dozens of tactical approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of spirit beasts to freely capture and collect, classic skill-book fusion system, freely assignable stat points, and the ability to switch between DPS / Tank / Support roles on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely craft your equipment, freely mix and match builds, and journey across the realms of man, god, and demon to establish a new order of coexistence in this wild primordial world.</p>", "short_description": "《Celestial Moon》 – Eastern Myth Turn-Based Officially Live!", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659560/0c9bafba0f5444d7bb928441f1203fc40749c1e4/header.jpg?t=1784698488", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659560/58c6782f87cd7ab49758a5907f4cca707c61a63f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784698488", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659560/58c6782f87cd7ab49758a5907f4cca707c61a63f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784698488", "website": null, "pc_requirements":